OL,3,GNEWSAMinister's alleged sexual touching
OL,4,Awas 'disguised'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minister who was a senior member of
OL,7,Fthe Methodist Church in Cornwall
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted five women over an
OL,9,F11-year period, a court has heard.
OL,11,FAt Truro Crown Court, prosecutor Brian
OL,12,FFitzherbert said Steven Wild assaulted
OL,13,Fthe women who came into contact with
OL,14,Fhim because of their involvement with
OL,15,Fthe church.
OL,17,FWild, 72, of St Ives, Cornwall, denied
OL,18,F11 charges of sexual assault and
OL,19,Findecent assault between 2004 and 2015.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
