OL,3,GNEWSAMinister's alleged sexual touching
OL,4,Awas 'disguised'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFitzherbert told it was not the
OL,7,Fprosecution's case that Wild was
OL,8,Fviolent or used force, and told the
OL,9,Fjury the sexual assaults were
OL,10,F"non-consensual sexual touching" which
OL,11,Foften happened in public.
